$BG,0$$FG,15$ZealOS TLS Implementation Design Document$FG,0$$BG,15$

Author: Claude Code Assistant
Date: December 2025
Status: Draft

$BG,0$$FG,15$1. OVERVIEW$FG,0$$BG,15$

This document describes the design for implementing TLS 1.3 (with TLS 1.2 fallback)
in ZealC for the ZealOS networking stack. The primary goal is to enable HTTPS
connections for accessing Discord's API.

$BG,0$$FG,14$1.1 Goals$FG,0$$BG,15$

- Implement TLS 1.3 client (RFC 8446)
- Support TLS 1.2 fallback for compatibility
- Minimal footprint suitable for ZealOS
- Enable HTTPS and WSS (WebSocket Secure) connections
- Self-contained implementation (no external dependencies)

$BG,0$$FG,14$1.2 Non-Goals$FG,0$$BG,15$

- TLS server implementation
- Client certificate authentication
- 0-RTT resumption (security trade-off)
- All cipher suites (only essential ones)

$BG,0$$FG,15$2. ARCHITECTURE$FG,0$$BG,15$

$BG,0$$FG,14$2.1 File Organization$FG,0$$BG,15$

C:/Home/Net/
+-- Crypto/
|   +-- Crypto.HH          // Common crypto definitions
|   +-- SHA256.ZC          // SHA-256 hash function
|   +-- SHA384.ZC          // SHA-384 hash function (uses SHA-512 internally)
|   +-- SHA512.ZC          // SHA-512 hash function
|   +-- HMAC.ZC            // HMAC construction
|   +-- HKDF.ZC            // HKDF key derivation (RFC 5869)
|   +-- AES.ZC             // AES block cipher (128/256-bit keys)
|   +-- GCM.ZC             // Galois/Counter Mode
|   +-- X25519.ZC          // Curve25519 ECDH
|   +-- BigInt.ZC          // Big integer arithmetic (for X25519)
|   +-- Random.ZC          // Cryptographic random number generator
|   +-- MakeCrypto.ZC      // Crypto module loader
|
+-- TLS/
|   +-- TLS.HH             // TLS definitions, constants, structures
|   +-- TLSRecord.ZC       // TLS record layer
|   +-- TLSHandshake.ZC    // TLS handshake protocol
|   +-- TLSCrypto.ZC       // TLS-specific crypto operations
|   +-- TLSSocket.ZC       // TLS socket wrapper (CTLSSocket)
|   +-- X509.ZC            // X.509 certificate parsing (minimal)
|   +-- MakeTLS.ZC         // TLS module loader
|
+-- Protocols/
|   +-- HTTP.ZC            // HTTP/1.1 client
|   +-- WebSocket.ZC       // WebSocket client (RFC 6455)

