SHA-384/512         |   400  | Medium
HMAC                |   150  | Easy
HKDF                |   100  | Easy
AES                 |   500  | Hard
GCM                 |   400  | Hard
X25519              |   600  | Hard
BigInt (for X25519) |   400  | Medium
Random              |   150  | Medium
TLS.HH              |   200  | N/A
TLS Record          |   400  | Medium
TLS Handshake       |  1000  | Hard
TLS Crypto/Keys     |   400  | Hard
TLS Socket          |   300  | Medium
X509 (minimal)      |   500  | Medium
HTTP                |   600  | Medium
WebSocket           |   500  | Medium
--------------------|--------|------------
TOTAL               | ~6500  |

